OL,3,GNEWSAComedy festival firm had debts of
OL,4,Amore than #200k
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm behind one of the UK's biggest
OL,7,Fcomedy festivals accumulated debts of
OL,8,Fmore than #200,000 before it ceased
OL,9,Ftrading, according to the Live Comedy
OL,10,FAssociation.
OL,12,FThe Big Difference Company - which ran
OL,13,FLeicester Comedy Festival - announced
OL,14,Fearlier in August "with great sadness"
OL,15,Fthat it had become insolvent.
OL,17,FA new festival has been set up - the
OL,18,FIndependent Comedy Festival - by
OL,19,Fstand-up comedian Alex Hylton and
OL,20,Fpromoter Colin Bowles, who said it
OL,21,Fwould take place in February 2027.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
