OL,3,GNEWSAComedy festival firm had debts of
OL,4,Amore than #200k
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe LCA said more than 100 people had
OL,7,Fbeen listed as being owed money in a
OL,8,Fstatement of affairs, but added it had
OL,9,Freceived information that this figure
OL,10,Fcould be a "conservative" estimate.
